 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/01/us/vieques-puerto-rico-hurricane.html', 'snippet': 'Residents of this island off the coast of Puerto Rico feel even more cut off than other Puerto Ricans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VIEQUES, P.R. — Solitude used to be an allure of life on this island apart from an island. Fish shacks served grouper pulled straight from the sea. Wild horses roamed the twisting roads. Tourists flocked to the beaches and glowing bays of an area left undeveloped for decades when it was a Navy bombing range.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/us/02vieques-slide-7G7J/02vieques-slide-7G7J-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/01/us/02vieques-slide-7G7J/02vieques-slide-7G7J-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/us/02vieques-slide-7G7J/02vieques-slide-7G7J-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/us/02vieques-slide-7G7J/02vieques-slide-7G7J-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/01/us/02vieques-slide-7G7J/02vieques-slide-7G7J-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/01/us/02vieques-slide-7G7J/02vieques-slide-7G7J-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype