 viewed videos of the blast, and witnesses recounted the injuries they suffered as a result.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/02/nyregion/defendant-in-chelsea-bombing-case-interrupts-opening-statement.html', 'snippet': 'On the first day of Ahmad Khan Rahimi’s trial, jurors viewed videos of the blast, and witnesses recounted the injuries they suffered as a result.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trial of the man charged with detonating a bomb in Chelsea last year began Monday in Federal District Court in Manhattan with video replays of the blast, emotional testimony from people wounded by shrapnel and an outburst by the defendant that led to his ejection from the courtroom.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/03/nyregion/03chelsea/03chelsea-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 906, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Chelsea Bombing Trial, Witnesses Tell of Blood and Blindness', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Witnesses Recall Deafening Blast and Shrapnel in Chelsea Bombing Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chelsea, Manhattan Bombing (2016)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chelsea (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rahimi, Ahmad Khan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berman, Richard M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-02T15:55:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson and Colin Moynihan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Colin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moynihan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/15a391b0-f6b4-5ae3-ad2d-7d2b1d0d605f', 'word_count': 969, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15a391b0-f6b4-5ae3-ad2d-7d2b1d0d605f'}, {'abstract': 'General Motors says it will add at least 20 electric vehicles to its lineup by 2023. Ford followed with its own initiative with 13 offerings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/02/business/general-motors-electric-cars.html', 'snippet': 'General Motors says it will add at least 20 electric vehicles to its lineup by 2023. Ford followed with its own initiative with 13 offerings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DET