', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6b7adb4-34e3-5e2c-a62a-158190b44cdc', 'word_count': 1257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6b7adb4-34e3-5e2c-a62a-158190b44cdc'}, {'abstract': 'A singer, songwriter and guitarist, Mr. Petty melded California rock with a Southern heritage in hits like “American Girl” and “Free Fallin’.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/03/arts/music/tom-petty-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A singer, songwriter and guitarist, Mr. Petty melded California rock with a Southern heritage in hits like “American Girl” and “Free Fallin’.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom Petty, a singer, songwriter and guitarist who melded California rock with a deep, stubborn Southern heritage to produce a long string of durable hits, died on Monday in Los Angeles. He was 66.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tom Petty, a Mainstay of Rock With the Heartbreakers, Dies at 66', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tom Petty, Rocker Who Wrote Durable, Defiant Hits, Dies at 66', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Petty, Tom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-03T04:08:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/e551b584-fa06-56e6-b048-f10a6bd76d51', 'word_count': 1788, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e551b584-fa06-56e6-b048-f10a6bd76d51'}, {'abstract': 'The document, a due diligence report about Uber’s acquisition of an autonomous trucking start-up, contains details about whether Uber may have known it was getting stolen information.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/03/technology/waymo-uber-document-secrets.html', 'snippet': 'The document, a due diligence report about Uber’s acquisition of an autonomous trucking start-up, contains details about whether Uber may have known it was getting stolen information.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Waymo, Alphabet’s self-driving car unit, has been fighting in the courts for months to gain access to a key document in a trade secrets case that it has waged against Uber. That document became public late Monday, adding to the intrigue of whether Uber may have known it was getting stolen information for its autonomous vehicles operation.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/world/03waymo-1/03waymo-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/04/world/03waymo-1/03waymo-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/world/03waymo-1/03waymo-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/world/03waymo-1/03waymo-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/04/world/03waymo-1/03waymo-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype