 'uri': 'nyt://article/29eca4c1-f13a-5829-92cc-a93465e14945'}, {'abstract': 'No wired headphone jack on your new phone? Here’s how to figure out whether wireless is best for you, and which headphones to buy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/03/smarter-living/wireless-headphone-jack.html', 'snippet': 'No wired headphone jack on your new phone? Here’s how to figure out whether wireless is best for you, and which headphones to buy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like it or not, more smartphone manufacturers are ditching headphone jacks to make their devices slimmer and trimmer. The charitable companies offer dongles that let you use standard headphones, but most would prefer you buy wireless versions instead. Whether you listen to music while you run, work out at the gym, ride the train, or just as you walk around, here’s how to figure out whether wireless is best for you, and which headphones to buy.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/02/us/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/02/us/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/02/us/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/02/us/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794/merlin-to-scoop-111501701-913794-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'sup