ke boardroom changes. With its board in need of new skills, Nestlé can beat him to the punch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/03/business/dealbook/nestle-dan-loeb.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Loeb’s hedge fund has a $3.5 billion stake in Nestle and may seek to make boardroom changes. With its board in need of new skills, Nestlé can beat him to the punch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nestlé can pre-empt the activist Dan Loeb’s next move. Directors at the $265 billion Kit Kat maker are light on consumer and digital expertise. Half the 14-member board is from Switzerland, the company’s home market but one that’s worth just 2 percent of sales. Nestlé’s latest plans to revamp are far from radical, and Mr. Loeb, the founder of Third Point, may next seek boardroom changes. Nestlé could head off a fight by beating him to it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/business/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/04/business/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/business/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/business/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/04/business/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS/04DB-NESTLEVIEWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 