efe-15b8-5006-a8c7-2941efe36c9f'}, {'abstract': 'Financing for the Children’s Health Insurance Program expired on Sunday, leaving states to prepare contingencies as lawmakers struggle for legislative consensus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/03/us/politics/childrens-health-insurance-program-expired-congress.html', 'snippet': 'Financing for the Children’s Health Insurance Program expired on Sunday, leaving states to prepare contingencies as lawmakers struggle for legislative consensus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Federal officials on Monday approved a $3.6 million emergency infusion for Minnesota after the state’s human services chief warned that pregnant women and some children were at imminent risk of losing health care coverage under the Children’s Health Insurance Program.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/us/04dc-chip/merlin-to-scoop-127910354-663844-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/04/us/04dc-chip/merlin-to-scoop-127910354-663844-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/us/04dc-chip/merlin-to-scoop-127910354-663844-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/04/us/04dc-chip/merlin-to-scoop-127910354-663844-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/04/us/04dc-chip/merlin-to-scoop-127910354-663844-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, '