fy the common qualities of figures as different as Abraham Lincoln, Ernest Shackleton and Rachel Carson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Business school case studies involve a wide range of situations in which critical decisions have been or must be made. The best cases provide all the essential background and detail that the decision-maker had at his or her disposal, with enough narrative momentum to make it engaging — but without implying a judgment or suggesting a preferred path.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/05/business/00DB-BOOKS/00DB-BOOKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1040, 'width': 1559, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_