itage Month, which runs from Sept. 15 through Oct. 15, here are seven spots to celebrate, from Seville to Montevideo. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/05/travel/hispanic-heritage-destinations.html', 'snippet': ' In honor of National Hispanic Heritage Month, which runs from Sept. 15 through Oct. 15, here are seven spots to celebrate, from Seville to Montevideo. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'National Hispanic Heritage Month, observed by Americans every Sept. 15 through Oct. 15, is a time to reflect on and appreciate Hispanic culture and its contributions to our country. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-thumbLarge.jpg