ent changes in travel restrictions required the Supreme Court to dismiss earlier challenges to the ban.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/05/us/politics/trump-supreme-court-travel-ban.html', 'snippet': 'The two sides disagreed on whether recent changes in travel restrictions required the Supreme Court to dismiss earlier challenges to the ban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Trump administration urged the Supreme Court on Thursday to dismiss two cases challenging its revised travel ban, issued in March, saying they are moot in light of recent developments. But the plaintiffs urged the justices to decide the cases notwithstanding recent changes in the scope and duration of the travel restrictions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/us/06dc-travelban/06dc-travelban-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/06/us/06dc-travelban/06dc-travelban-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/us/06dc-travelban/06dc-travelban-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/us/06dc-travelban/06dc-travelban-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/06/us/06dc-travelban/06dc-travelban-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/us/06dc-travelban/06dc-travelban-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width':