fake-news-and-sleep-our-favorite-student-comments-of-the-week.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the best responses from the last several days, and an invitation to join the conversation yourself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each week on our site, we post new writing prompts inspired by Times articles or images, and we hear from teenagers all over the world in response. Below, we feature some of the best comments that have come in over the last seven days — and give a special shout out to the students in Wilmington, N.C., whose comments we have enjoyed on many posts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/08/nyregion/xxawkward4-LN/xxawkward4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/08/nyregion/xxawkward4-LN/xxawkward4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/08/nyregion/xxawkward4-LN/xxawkward4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/08/nyregion/xxawkward4-LN/xxawkward4-articleLarge-v6.gif', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/08/nyregion/xxawkward4-LN/xxawkward4-articleLarge-v6.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/08/nyregion/xxawkward4-LN/xxawkward4-jumbo-v2.gif', 'height': 540, 'width': 540, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/08/