e a bummed-out consultant: “Employees were tired. They were frustrated. They were fed up with losing and falling behind. … They came to Microsoft with big dreams, but it felt like all they really did was deal with upper management, execute taxing processes and bicker in meetings.” In other words, they were shocked to find they worked in corporate America.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 601}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/06/books/review/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2/1015-BKS-LIST-master1050-v2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Microsoft’s Chief Wants You to Know He’s a Different Kind of Leader', 'kicker': 'Inside the List', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "Hit Refresh: The Quest to Rediscover Microsoft's Soul and Imagine a Better Future for Everyone (Book)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadella, Satya', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-06T17:51:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gregory Cowles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gregory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/03c259a6-79b4-51b9-85f8-b62f249e3c7b', 'word_count': 406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03c259a6-79b4-51b9-85f8-b62f249e3c7b'}, {'abstract': 'A sometime interior designer himself, Mr. Walrod knew a lot about a lot and shared it with those outfitting restaurants, hotels and homes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/06/obituaries/jim-walrod-sought-after-guide-to-worlds-of-design-dies-at-56.html', 'snippet': 'A sometime interior designer himself, Mr. Walrod knew a lot about a lot and shared it with those outfitting restaurants, hotels and homes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the trendsetting world covered by style magazines, there are headline names — artists, fashionistas, celebrities — but there are also facilitato