ry where it's hard to have individual style,” said Rose Cromwell, a photographer who has been going to Cuba since 2005. ", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/07/style/cuba-personal-style.html', 'snippet': "“I was drawn to people really striving for individual style in a country where it's hard to have individual style,” said Rose Cromwell, a photographer who has been going to Cuba since 2005. ", 'lead_paragraph': 'Angel Lazaro, 29, was hanging out with his friends (who call him Mayito) at Bar Roma, on the rooftop of a 1920s building in Old Havana. Mr. Lazaro hadn’t ended up at the bar from seeing it on the street. There was no sign outside indicating that a ride up in a rickety open-air elevator would lead him to one of the city’s most interesting watering holes.  ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/fashion/08THELOOK1-2/08THELOOK1-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/08/fashion/08THELOOK1-2/08THELOOK1-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 777}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/fashion/08THELOOK1-2/08THELOOK1-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 792, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/fashion/08THELOOK1-2/08THELOOK1-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1583, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/fashion/08THELOOK1-2/08THELOOK1-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard