{'abstract': 'President Trump’s plan would make it easier for consumers to band together and buy insurance on their own, but critics warn of risks to consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/07/us/politics/trump-association-health-plans.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump’s plan would make it easier for consumers to band together and buy insurance on their own, but critics warn of risks to consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Stymied in his efforts to repeal the Affordable Care Act, President Trump is poised to issue an order that could ease some federal rules governing health insurance and make it easier for people to band together and buy coverage on their own, administration officials said Saturday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/us/08dc-Health2/08dc-Health2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/08/us/08dc-Health2/08dc-Health2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/us/08dc-Health2/08dc-Health2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/us/08dc-Health2/08dc-Health2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/08/us/08dc-Health2/08dc-Health2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/08/us/08dc-Health2/08dc-Health2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width'