ly been to reassure, to beg for calm, and to try to get kids back to school as quickly as possible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/09/well/family/the-latest-on-lice.html', 'snippet': 'The pediatric role in recent years has largely been to reassure, to beg for calm, and to try to get kids back to school as quickly as possible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many other parents, I’ve paid my dues when it comes to head lice. It was a while ago, back in day care, and there was a dress-up box with hats and crowns and helmets that was probably the smoking gun. We all had to do the whole routine, applying insecticide rinses to our children’s heads and washing sheets and pillow cases in hot water, and becoming somewhat fanatical about not sharing hats.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/well/family/well-family-lice/well-family-lice-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/09/well/family/well-family-lice/well-family-lice-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/well/family/well-family-lice/well-family-lice-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/well/family/well-family-lice/well-family-lice-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/09/well/family/well-family-lice/well-family-lice-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20