'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d088798e-e54f-5c78-afc1-569dc9158a0f', 'word_count': 874, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d088798e-e54f-5c78-afc1-569dc9158a0f'}, {'abstract': 'The hush in Hollywood about the megaproducer only reinforces a culture that keeps women from speaking up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/09/opinion/harvey-weinstein-lena-dunham-silence-.html', 'snippet': 'The hush in Hollywood about the megaproducer only reinforces a culture that keeps women from speaking up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I went to Hollywood when I was 23. I had made a low-budget film, won an award at a prestigious festival, scored an agent and made a TV deal all within six months. It was a fairy tale most people will never experience, and I knew, as well as a 23-year-old can know anything, that I was getting a pretty great deal. I bounced from meeting to meeting with the joy of Cinderella at the ball.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/opinion/09dunhamWeb/09dunhamWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/10/opinion/09dunhamWeb/09dunhamWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/opinion/09dunhamWeb/09dunhamWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/opinion/09dunhamWeb/09dunhamWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':