ways across the four fashion capitals — each with a different hair-and-makeup look. “This time, there was more of an emphasis on natural beauty,” she noted, instead of the “no-makeup” look that actually requires gobs of products. “At some shows, they put on a tiny bit of foundation, and that’s all.” Backstage, she learned that to keep lips moisturized, “you should use lip conditioner and not Chapstick, because Chapstick is mostly a protector,” she shared, a tip worth keeping in mind year-round. Here, Taylor’s season of beauty looks, in pictures.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-cara/09tmag-cara-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-cara/09tmag-cara-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-cara/09tmag-cara-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-cara/09tmag-cara-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-cara/09tmag-cara-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-cara/09tmag-cara-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/09/t-magazine/