 many Latinos and Muslims.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump’s Argument Against Immigrants: We’ve Heard It Before', 'kicker': 'Retro Report', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Failed Referendum That Propelled Policy on Migrants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Border Barriers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Pete', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-09T22:30:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clyde Haberman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clyde', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haberman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6965fa1-fb4b-561d-83a8-c79ec347a941', 'word_count': 1086, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6965fa1-fb4b-561d-83a8-c79ec347a941'}, {'abstract': 'At the height of his fame Mr. Leroux dressed celebrities and jet-setters in his figure-hugging creations. Then he lost control of the name that had made him famous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/09/obituaries/herv-leroux-dead-creator-of-the-herv-leger-bandage-dress.html', 'snippet': 'At the height of his fame Mr. Leroux dressed celebrities and jet-setters in his figure-hugging creations. Then he lost control of the name that had made him famo