allment in the Skywalker saga, due Dec. 15.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/09/movies/star-wars-the-last-jedi-trailer.html', 'snippet': 'Rey, Luke Skywalker and General Organa have prominent roles in the promo for the next installment in the Skywalker saga, due Dec. 15.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Look who’s back! Fans saw more of Mark Hamill’s Luke Skywalker in the 154-second trailer unveiled Monday night for “Star Wars: The Last Jedi,” than they did in the entire 135-minute running time of “Star Wars: The Force Awakens” in 2015. That film featured only a brief glimpse of the Jedi knight in its final scene, but he appears to be back in force for the next installment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/movies/10star-wars-trailer2/10star-wars-trailer2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 249, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/11/movies/10star-wars-trailer2/10star-wars-trailer2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 249}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/movies/10star-wars-trailer2/10star-wars-trailer2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 850, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/movies/10star-wars-trailer2/10star-wars-trailer2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 850, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/movies/10star-wars-trailer2/10star-wars-trailer2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/11/movies/10s