 editor of British Elle Decoration and gaining global acclaim for her interiors at Manhattan’s Soho House — seems like a product of her parentage. Her Danish mother was an artist; her Canadian father was the economics editor of The Sunday Times of London. “I have both the analytical and the instinctual,” she says. “Working at a magazine taught me how to communicate my ideas, but like an artist, I’m willing to make some mistakes.”', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '98', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/t-magazine/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/10/t-magazine/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/t-magazine/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 887, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/t-magazine/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 887, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/10/t-magazine/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/10/t-magazine/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04/ilse-crawford-slide-QV04-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th