s://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/10/sports/baseball/cody-bellinger-dodgers-sweep.html', 'snippet': 'Cody Bellinger, a rookie first baseman, had his first significant moments of the postseason, and that was good enough to propel Los Angeles into the N.L.C.S.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHOENIX — During the regular season, Cody Bellinger exhibited the poise and production of a veteran. But in his first postseason he was looking every bit the rookie. With Los Angeles trying to sweep its National League division series against the Arizona Diamondbacks, Bellinger, the Dodgers’ first baseman and cleanup hitter, was pressing badly.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/sports/11bellinger/11bellinger-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/11/sports/11bellinger/11bellinger-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/sports/11bellinger/11bellinger-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/sports/11bellinger/11bellinger-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1445, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/11/sports/11bellinger/11bellinger-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/11/sports/11bellinger/11bellinger-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'