b2', 'word_count': 1027, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b05a0538-637d-5bf5-aff6-a889b56e54b2'}, {'abstract': 'The Tehani Photo Workshop, started by Stephanie Sinclair and the Samburu Girls Foundation, provides both photo skills and a community for girls rescued from child marriage.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2017/10/11/empowering-girls-rescued-from-child-marriage/', 'snippet': 'The Tehani Photo Workshop, started by Stephanie Sinclair and the Samburu Girls Foundation, provides both photo skills and a community for girls rescued from child marriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Having spent 15 years photographing child marriages around the world, Stephanie Sinclair is uniquely positioned to understand its lasting impact on communities and, especially, on the girls who were forced to wed against their will. “You can’t expect individuals who have been through significant abuse to just act normal as soon as they get out of that situation,” she said. “They need to be nurtured, to be given the time and the tools to heal.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Empowering Girls Rescued From Child Marriage', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Female Genital Mutilation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tehani Photo Workshop', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-11T08:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline':