es what its network does best.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/11/arts/television/the-mayor-ghosted-tv-review.html', 'snippet': 'Each series does what its network does best.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most popular comedy in America is “The Big Bang Theory,” now in its 11th season. The second most popular is “Modern Family,” now in its ninth season. Despite the vast altars on which networks make gruesome sacrifices while cantillating to their gods, neither of these shows will last forever. Some day, a new network comedy will ascend.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/12/arts/television/12ghosted/12ghosted-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/12/arts/television/12ghosted/12ghosted-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/12/arts/television/12ghosted/12ghosted-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/12/arts/television/12ghosted/12ghosted-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/12/arts/television/12ghosted/12ghosted-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/12/arts/television/12ghosted/12ghosted-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':