: 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a1064fa-abc5-5d1d-8e9f-1fcb775b1621', 'word_count': 1165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a1064fa-abc5-5d1d-8e9f-1fcb775b1621'}, {'abstract': 'For this issue, a look at the struggle to help anxious teenagers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/13/magazine/behind-the-cover-10-15-17.html', 'snippet': 'For this issue, a look at the struggle to help anxious teenagers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jake Silverstein, editor in chief: “We dramatically cropped the portrait of Jillian, a teenager in Benoit Denizet-Lewis’s article about adolescent anxiety, to make clear that she was meant to represent not just herself but all kids who suffer this way. We also liked the way that the weight of that heavy black rectangle looming above her seemed to nicely capture the sense of helplessness many of these teens feel.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/15/magazine/15cover-type/15cover-type-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/15/magazine/15cover-type/15cover-type-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 730}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/15/magazine/15cover-type/15cover-type-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 842, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/15/magazine/15cover-type/15cover-type-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 16