amily.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/13/world/canada/canada-letter-sears-liquidates-hostages-rescued-weinstein-accusers.html', 'snippet': 'This week’s letter looks at the death of Sears and, with it, the end of mail-order catalog shopping. We also look at the dramatic rescue of a Canadian-American family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many Canadians, catalog shopping was as much culture as commerce. A mail-order mix-up, for example, is at the heart of Roch Carrier’s “The Hockey Sweater,” a classic children’s book that became an equally celebrated animated film.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/14/world/canada/14canadaletter-searsperth/14canadaletter-searsperth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/14/world/canada/14canadaletter-searsperth/14canadaletter-searsperth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/14/world/canada/14canadaletter-searsperth/14canadaletter-searsperth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/14/world/canada/14canadaletter-searsperth/14canadaletter-searsperth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/14/world/canada/14canadaletter-searsperth/14canadaletter-searsperth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/14/world/canada/14canadaletter-searsperth/14canada