nyregion/arts-festival-catholic-church-gay-themed-performances.html', 'snippet': 'A human rights festival slated for a church hall has moved to a new venue after archdiocese officials expressed their disapproval of some parts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A human rights arts festival scheduled to take place on Sunday in a Lower East Side church hall was scrambling for a new venue after top officials of the New York Archdiocese expressed last-minute concerns that performances dealing with gay and transgender issues were not in line with church teaching.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Festival Moves Event After Church Objects to Gay-Themed Content', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rights Festival Pulls Out After Church Objects to Gay-Themed Content', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexuals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Culture Project', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dolan, Timothy M', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Kathleen', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lower East Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-13T23:12:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name