 '_id': 'nyt://article/e61a3ca0-2d34-5914-b9f1-f629e26421ee', 'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e61a3ca0-2d34-5914-b9f1-f629e26421ee'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Noah said that the president’s most recent news conference had “derailed,” and wondered “why Republicans insist on letting Donald Trump speak.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/18/arts/television/trevor-noah-trump-mcconnell-unity.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Noah said that the president’s most recent news conference had “derailed,” and wondered “why Republicans insist on letting Donald Trump speak.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to Best of Late Night, a rundown that lets you sleep — and lets us get paid to watch comedy. What do you think of it? What else are you interested in? Let us know: thearts@nytimes.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 328, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 328}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-jumbo.png', 'height': 559, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 786, 'width': 1440, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/arts/18latenight1/18latenight1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trevor Noah Can’t Believe Republicans Still Let Trump Speak', 'kicker': 'Best of Late Night', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Noah, Trevor (1984- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Letterman, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kimmel, Jimmy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jefferies, Jim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McConnell, Mitch', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Conan", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Daily Show with Trevor Noah (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-18T08:45:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Giovanni Russonello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Giovanni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Russonello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f88cf7ec-14f9-501b-b63f-ffd6f97cab7f', 'word_count': 729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f88cf7ec-14f9-501b-b63f-ffd6f97cab7f'}, {'abstract': 'Misogyny and abuse are rampant in society. But the military is well equipped to stop it in its own ranks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/18/opinion/military-women-molested.html', 'snippet': 'Misogyny and abuse are rampant in society. But the military is well equipped to stop it in its own ranks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was 2004 and I had been in the Army for only three months when I first began to suspect something was wrong. I was walking by our drill sergeant’s desk, where he sat, leaning back in his chair. On the floor in front of him was a newly arrived female soldier. She was on her back, dressed in T-shirt and shorts, doing scissor kicks. He sat perfectly poised to see her crotch and the insides of her thighs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/18/opinion/18venkatesanWeb/18venkatesanWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Military Women, Too, Should Serve Unmolested', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-18T08:55:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Supriya Venkatesan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Supriya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Venkatesan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ac40de1-a1af-5b9d-baf2-6abf129495ae', 'word_count': 1517, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ac40de1-a1af-5b9d-baf2-6abf129495ae'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans are using the budget process to invade the pristine Arctic National Wildlife Refuge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/18/opinion/protect-alaskas-last-great-wilderness-from-oil-drilling.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans are using the budget process to invade the pristine Arctic National Wildlife Refuge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few landscapes remain virtually untrammeled by the growing impact of the planet’s seven and a half billion inhabitants — places where the natural environment is so overwhelmingly intact and truly wild that coming across so much as a boot print is a surprise. It seems unlikely in this day and age, but such areas do still exist.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multi