-60355395b849', 'word_count': 2277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c346f4c-a459-54a0-b8d0-60355395b849'}, {'abstract': 'Here’s how to get a jump on next season’s trends right now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/18/style/spring-2018-trends-shopping.html', 'snippet': 'Here’s how to get a jump on next season’s trends right now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s good to be ahead of the curve, especially when it comes to fashion. The spring 2018 collections, fresh off the runways, offered a little something for everyone. Provocateurs may gravitate toward the completely sheer (at Sonia Rykiel) or fringe laden (Calvin Klein); pragmatists will appreciate the abundance of blazers (Balenciaga), anoraks (Public School) and trench coats (Margiela). There were also some surprises: Bicycle shorts, which haven’t seen the light of the runway in some time, showed up at Dolce & Gabbana, Off-White and Saint Laurent, a welcome addition for the shorts lover who’s after more coverage but doesn’t exactly yearn for baggy Bermudas. Here, a look at some of the trends — and how to wear them now.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/19/fashion/19BROWSING-COMBO1/19BROWSING-COMBO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 265, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/19/fashion/19BROWSING-COMBO1/19BROWSING-COMBO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 265}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/19/fashion/19BROWSING-COMBO1/19BROWSING-COMBO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/19/fashion/19BROWSING-COMBO1/19BROWSING-COMBO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 905, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'su