rnage turned the organization into an advocacy group and did battle against President Ronald Reagan’s environmental policies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/18/obituaries/william-turnage-who-reinvented-the-wilderness-society-is-dead-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Turnage turned the organization into an advocacy group and did battle against President Ronald Reagan’s environmental policies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William Turnage, who changed the Wilderness Society from a grass-roots organization devoted to protecting public lands to a more professional advocacy group in time to do battle against President Ronald Reagan’s environmental policies, died on Sunday at his home in Mill Valley, Calif. He was 74.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/21/arts/20turnage-obit-1/19turnage-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 493, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/21/arts/20turnage-obit-1/19turnage-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 493, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/21/arts/20turnage-obit-1/19turnage-obit-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/21/arts/20turnage-obit-1/19turnage-obit-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'William Turnage, Who Reinvented the Wilderness Society, Is Dead at 74', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'William Turnage, 74, Whose Wildlife Group Rose to Battle, Is Dead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywor