aterial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec52f945-bf87-5f40-8f04-5b72753afbb1', 'word_count': 767, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec52f945-bf87-5f40-8f04-5b72753afbb1'}, {'abstract': 'This documentary focuses on the hyperkinetic card magician Richard Turner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/19/movies/dealt-review-richard-turner.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary focuses on the hyperkinetic card magician Richard Turner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The card magician Richard Turner reveals that he has more than just a few tricks up his sleeve in Luke Korem’s captivating documentary “Dealt.” Mr. Turner’s magic prowess lies in his nimble hands that manipulate any deck of cards. But behind the facade of a self-assured showman is the secret Mr. Turner tries to keep to himself: He’s blind.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/merlin-to-scoop-128780873-333790-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/merlin-to-scoop-128780873-333790-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/merlin-to-scoop-128780873-333790-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/merlin-to-scoop-128780873-333790-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/DEALT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/DEALT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/movies/20DEALT1/DEALT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Dealt,’ a Magician Never Shows His Hand (Until He Does)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dealt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Dealt (Movie)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Richard (1954- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magic and Magicians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Korem, Luke', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-19T11:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Monica Castillo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Monica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castillo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6aeaa7e-859c-56e2-b1b2-4a7ee03af34a', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6aeaa7e-859c-56e2-b1b2-4a7ee03af34a'}, {'abstract': 'This documentary follows Izak Szewelewicz, who was sent to Israel as a toddler after World War II, on a search for the brother he didn’t know he had.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/19/movies/aidas-secrets-review.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary follows Izak Szewelewicz, who was sent to Israel as a toddler after World War II, on a search for the brother he didn’t know he had.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Directed by Alon and Shaul Schwarz, “Aida’s Secrets” chronicles one man’s late-in-life search for his brother, from whom he was separated as a toddler at the Bergen-Belsen displaced persons camp after World War II. But the remarkable tale it tells — of a family split up and dispersed to different continents, and the detective work required to figure out what had happened — turns this documentary into a fascinating mystery of reshuffled identities. In this time of mass displacement across the globe, it is a stark reminder of how traumatic the refugee experience often is.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1116, 'width': 1983, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/20/arts/20aida2/20aida2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Uncovering a Displaced Family’s Past in ‘Aida’s Secrets’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Aida’s Secrets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "Aida's Secrets (Movie)", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Szewelewicz, Izak', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwarz, Shaul', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwarz, Alon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concentration Camps', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-19T11:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel M. Gold', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/386283c9-2b3b-59e1-85fa-110dcb5edc9e', 'word_count': 288, 'uri': 'nyt://article/386283c9-2b3b-59e1-85fa-110dcb5edc9e'}, {'abstract': 'When the American Express C.E.O. steps down in February, there may be just three black men running Fortune 500 companies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/19/business/dealbook/ken-chenault-american-express.html', 'snippet': 'When the American Express C.E.O. steps down in February, there may be just three black men running Fortune 500 companies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good Thursday morning from Andrew Ross Sorkin in New York and Michael J. de la Merced and Amie Tsang in Lond