 my studio apartment on East 23rd Street in Manhattan and in with my mother in Sheepshead Bay, Brooklyn. Since taking a buyout at my Wall Street firm, I had devoted myself to two activities: searching for a new job and working out. And I spent a lot of time in my apartment.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 753}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 817, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1633, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/31/fashion/31LOVEADVICE-6/22MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Single, Unemployed and Suddenly Myself', 'kicker': 'Moder