}, {'abstract': 'Immigrants and their stories were long essential to studios. So why haven’t they greenlit movies about the current generation of Dreamers?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/20/movies/dreamers-undocumented-immigrants-hollywood.html', 'snippet': 'Immigrants and their stories were long essential to studios. So why haven’t they greenlit movies about the current generation of Dreamers?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Immigration is a part of Hollywood’s story just as much as it is America’s. In the early years of cinema, many of the first regular moviegoers were working-class immigrants. Immigrants founded major studios like Paramount and Warner Bros. in the early decades of the 20th century. And over the course of two world wars, talented directors and movie stars — mostly from Europe — poured into this country.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/22/arts/01DREAMER-FILM1/01DREAMER-FILM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/22/arts/01DREAMER-FILM1/01DREAMER-FILM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/22/arts/01DREAMER-FILM1/01DREAMER-FILM1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/22/arts/01DREAMER-FILM1/01DREAMER-FILM1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/22/arts/01DREAMER-FILM1/01DREAMER-FILM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':