8-58ef-8fda-4db1ecbc3ea7', 'word_count': 184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/855ffc32-aad8-58ef-8fda-4db1ecbc3ea7'}, {'abstract': 'Alexandra Rose Howland documented a community of internally displaced Abkhazians who made their home inside an abandoned hospital.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2017/10/23/after-fleeing-war-they-made-an-abandoned-hospital-home/', 'snippet': 'Alexandra Rose Howland documented a community of internally displaced Abkhazians who made their home inside an abandoned hospital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hospital, a cardiology institute in Abkhazia, shut down when the Soviet Union broke up in 1991. The following year, war made it a refuge. From 1992 to 1993, Russian-backed Abkhaz rebels pushed out Georgian troops in a proxy war, several dozen people squatted there, like countless others who were forced to flee their homes on the Black Sea’s east coast. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Fleeing War, They Made an Abandoned Hospital Their Home', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alexandra Rose Howland', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howland, Alexandra Rose', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ABKHAZIA (GEORGIAN REPUBLIC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-23T08:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Evelyn Nieves', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Evelyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nieves', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4b50577-bd78-5d91-a857-47b420bf3fa6', 'word_count': 686, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4b50577-bd78-5d91-a857-47b420bf3fa6'}, {'abstract': 'Protesters who shut down speech mimic the actions of those they say they oppose.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/23/opinion/fascism-protest-university-oregon.html', 'snippet': 'Protesters who shut down speech mimic the actions of those they say they oppose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This month, a handful of student protesters at the University of Oregon blocked me from delivering my state-of-the-university speech, one of my jobs as president. I had planned to announce a $50 million gift that would fund several new programs. I ended up posting a recorded version of the speech online.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/23/opinion/23oncampusWeb/23oncampusWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/23/opinion/23oncampusWeb/23oncampusWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/23/opinion/23oncampusWeb/23oncampusWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 615, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/23/opinion/23oncampusWeb/23oncampusWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1230, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/23/opinion/23oncampusWeb/23oncampusWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/23/opinion/