_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/23/sports/football/chicago-bears-mitchell-trubisky.html', 'snippet': 'Mitchell Trubisky and the Bears had the fewest passes attempted in a winning effort since 2006, and the fewest completions in a win since 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Chicago Bears beat the Panthers on Sunday, 17-3, and they did it with an unconventional game plan. The rookie quarterback Mitchell Trubisky’s final line was eyebrow-raising: 7 passes attempted, 4 completed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/sports/24bearsWEB1/24bearsWEB1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge