. director re-emerges on Twitter with some pensive pictures during a trip to Iowa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/23/us/politics/comey-on-twitter-contemplates-iowas-landscape-serenity-and-sunsets.html', 'snippet': 'The former F.B.I. director re-emerges on Twitter with some pensive pictures during a trip to Iowa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — James B. Comey, the former F.B.I. director, emerged from seclusion in recent days, appearing pensive and contemplative on a rural Iowa road and in a cornfield, based on photographs posted on his Twitter account.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/merlin-to-scoop-123219806-57070-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/merlin-to-scoop-123219806-57070-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/merlin-to-scoop-123219806-57070-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/merlin-to-scoop-123219806-57070-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/24dc-comey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/24dc-comey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/24/us/24dc-comey/24dc-comey-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Comey, on Twitter, Contemplates Iowa’s Landscape, Serenity and Sunsets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Emerging From Seclusion, Comey Contemplates Iowa’s Rural Majesty on Twitter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Comey, James B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-23T18:11:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eileen Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eileen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a55dcab-ec12-5014-8023-cb78eef34508', 'word_count': 450, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a55dcab-ec12-5014-8023-cb78eef34508'}, {'abstract': 'Hemlock Hill Farm in Cortlandt, N.Y., now operates a farm store with produce, meats and preserves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/23/dining/hemlock-hill-farm-store.html', 'snippet': 'Hemlock Hill Farm in Cortlandt, N.Y., now operates a farm store with produce, meats and preserves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The farm store at Hemlock Hill Farm, a 120-acre property in northern Westchester County, has been renovated, making it an excellent stop on a fall weekend en route to the Hudson Valley. Most of the produce sold here is grown on the farm — operated by the same family since 1939 — and the shop also sells meat and poultry, butchered and ready to cook, including grass-fed tri-tip Black Angus steaks. Artisanal products, including their own — like pickles, preserves, honeys, granola and dairy items — line the shelves and refrigerated cases. A food truck sells prepared breakfast and lunch dishes Thursdays to Saturdays: Hemlock Hill Farm, 500 Croton Avenue (Maple Avenue), Cortlandt, N.Y., 914-737-2810, hemlockhillfarm.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/25/dining/25burnerfarm/25burnerfarm-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width':