ay she spotted offshore a woman fishing from a boat, nets and lines in hand. She never spoke to the woman, but the memory stuck with her throughout her life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Italy’s 81-Year-Old ‘Bride of the Sea’', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Anna Maria Verzino', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Annalisa Marchionna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Commercial', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marchionna, Annalisa', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ADRIATIC SEA', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-25T08:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ania Bartkowiak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ania', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bartkowiak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff36c7de-2243-5eae-8b48-65f93eddbc10', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff36c7de-2243-5eae-8b48-65f93eddbc10'}, {'abstract': 'On “Late Night,” Mr. Meyers criticized Senator Flake of Arizona for voting to confirm certain members of the president’s cabinet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/25/arts/television/seth-meyers-jeff-flake-trump.html', 'snippet': 'On “Late Night,” Mr. Meyers criticized Senator Flake of Arizona for voting to confirm certain members of the president’s cabinet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to Best of Late Night, a rundown that lets you sleep — and lets us ge