of a swift legal thriller.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/25/books/review-john-grisham-rooster-bar.html', 'snippet': 'Grisham’s new novel translates the ethical and economic issues raised by student-entrapping practices into the high drama of a swift legal thriller.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Earlier this year, John Grisham announced that his next legal thriller would be about the scams behind many for-profit law schools. But it’s a long leap from subject matter to story, and Grisham’s newly reanimated storytelling skills are what make “The Rooster Bar” such a treat.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 846, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 846}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 727, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1453, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/books/26bookgrisham2/26bookgrisham2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'John Grisham Prosecutes For-Profit Law Schools in ‘The Rooster Bar’', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prosecuting For-Profit Law Schools', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grisham, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Rooster Bar (Book)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-25T18:56:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Janet Maslin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Janet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Maslin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bbe331a-ac23-5a3a-a820-1c6aaf83ee1d', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bbe331a-ac23-5a3a-a820-1c6aaf83ee1d'}, {'abstract': 'Looking for a last-minute costume that’s chic? We’ve got you covered.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/25/style/halloween-costumes-for-the-lazy.html', 'snippet': 'Looking for a last-minute costume that’s chic? We’ve got you covered.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are people who love Halloween and those who tolerate it. Regardless of which cohort you belong to, the best strategy, when confronted with a costume party invitation in your mailbox, is one of wardrobe opportunism: Use the holiday as an excuse to acquire high-end fall goods you’ve been eyeing. Happily, some of the season’s biggest trends lend themselves surprisingly well to a number of Halloween costumes. Here, four looks you’ll want to wear well after the Oct. 31.', 'source