 you can also clean out your computer manually.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/25/technology/personaltech/storage-space-mac.html', 'snippet': 'Newer versions of the Mac operating system have handy tools for managing your file storage, but you can also clean out your computer manually.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. I am trying to conserve space on my Mac, and I read about the storage-optimization tools on the Storage tab in the About This Mac box. However, when I open the box and click the Storage tab, I don’t have a Manage button to click and start the cleanup process. Why?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/technology/personaltech/26techtipwebART/26techtipwebART-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 844, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/26/technology/personaltech/26techtipwebART/26techtipwebART-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 844}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/technology/personaltech/26techtipwebART/26techtipwebART-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 729, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/technology/personaltech/26techtipwebART/26techtipwebART-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 973, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/technology/personaltech/26techtipwebART/26techtipwebART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/26/technology/personaltech/26techtipwebART/26techtipwebART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb