dam-lanza-sandy-hook.html', 'snippet': 'Newly released F.B.I. papers related to the 2012 massacre show that a man warned the police in 2008 that Mr. Lanza had spoken about attacking the school.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four years before Adam Lanza massacred more than two dozen people in Newtown, Conn., in 2012, police officials were warned of his homicidal plans, according to documents released by the F.B.I. this week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/26/us/26Lanza-2-sub/26Lanza-2-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Adam Lanza Threatened Sandy Hook Killings Years Earlier, Records Show', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Files Detail Warnings On Newtown Years Earlier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lanza, Adam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lanza, Nancy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newtown (Conn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-26T12:01:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Maya Salam', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Maya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Salam', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2dffdaaa-7af2-5ea9-8776-cc6d4c977c91', 'word_count': 777, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2dffdaaa-7af2-5ea9-8776-cc6d4c977c91'}, {'abstract': 'With his love of brass, arches and color, Harry Nuriev creates environments that seem tailor-made for the social media aesthetic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/26/t-magazine/design/harry-nuriev.html', 'snippet': 'With his love of brass, arches and color, Harry Nuriev creates environments that seem tailor-made for the social media aesthetic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF YOU’RE A DESIGN OBSESSIVE who follows a certain set of Instagram accounts — @studioyellowtrace, @_sightunseen_ and @somewhereiwouldliketolive, among others — then you’re likely conversant in the vocabulary of contemporary design as practiced by a group of youngish talents. There’s the prevalence of brass, the ubiquitous arches and the ambient influence of the ’70s and ’80s: that era of sunken living rooms, scalloped seating and “Golden Girls” peaches and pinks. Ettore Sottsass and his Memphis Group are routinely referenced, though the collective’s Day-Glo hues and cartoonish shapes tend to get reinterpreted as something less ebullient and more streamlined.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '66', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/11/12/t-magazine/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-copy/tmag-harry-slide-5NDV-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height