arvey and Irma, but protectionist policies could put the trend at risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/27/business/dealbook/economy-tax-cuts.html', 'snippet': 'The U.S. economy grew 3 percent last quarter, despite Hurricanes Harvey and Irma, but protectionist policies could put the trend at risk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It turns out that the United States economy is doing just fine without tax cuts. Initial estimates show the economy expanded at an annual rate of 3 percent in the third quarter, despite the effect of Hurricanes Harvey and Irma. An increase in goods made but not sold helped, but so did global growth and healthy corporate earnings. Protectionist policies could put the trend at risk.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/28/business/28DB-ECONVIEWS1/28DB-ECONVIEWS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/28/business/28DB-ECONVIEWS1/28DB-ECONVIEWS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/28/business/28DB-ECONVIEWS1/28DB-ECONVIEWS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/28/business/28DB-ECONVIEWS1/28DB-ECONVIEWS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/28/business/28DB-ECONVIEWS1/28DB-ECONVIEWS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/28/business/28DB-ECONVIEWS1/28D