paragraph': 'A Brooklyn grand jury has handed up an indictment in the case of an 18-year-old woman who said she was raped by two New York City police officers after they took her into custody and searched her for drugs, a person familiar with the case said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indictment Issued in Case of 18-Year-Old Who Said 2 Officers Raped Her', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jury Is Said to Issue Indictment in Brooklyn Detectives Rape Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martins, Edward (New York, NY, Police Officer)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hall, Richard (New York, NY, Police Officer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-10-27T23:52:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker, Alan Feuer and Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feuer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9b2d6e4-1738-5d42-89a5-1e6ca0c4fbd4', 'word_count': 826, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9b2d6e4-1738-5d42-89a5-1e6ca0c4fbd4'}, {'abstract': 'The disclosure raised questions about whether Pr