ticle/4824d68c-df7b-5fb8-9716-e5379bb816fe'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump likes to say he won’t cut taxes for rich people, but his press secretary just suggested otherwise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/30/us/politics/a-white-house-story-reveals-shifting-stance-on-tax-cuts-for-the-rich.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump likes to say he won’t cut taxes for rich people, but his press secretary just suggested otherwise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday, as news about the indictment of President Trump’s former campaign manager dominated the headlines, the White House press secretary, Sarah Huckabee Sanders, took to the podium to tell a story about journalists, bar tabs and discount beer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/31/business/31DC-TAX1/31DC-TAX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/10/31/business/31DC-TAX1/31DC-TAX1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/31/business/31DC-TAX1/31DC-TAX1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/31/business/31DC-TAX1/31DC-TAX1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/10/31/business/31DC-TAX1/31DC-TAX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/10/31/business/31DC-TAX1/31DC-TAX1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {